          <li><a href="guonei.html">冬季供暖首周投诉量同比下降一成八</a><time>11-17</time></li>
          <li><a href="article.html">灵活就业人员参保办理推行"掌上办"</a><time>11-16</time></li>
          <li><a href="keji.html">智慧农业示范区水肥一体化覆盖率超七成</a><time>11-15</time></li>
          <li><a href="caijing.html">制造业采购经理指数连续三月处于扩张区间</a><time>11-15</time></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <div class="card-hd"><h2>图片新闻</h2><span><a href="keji.html">更多 &gt;</a></span></div>
    <div class="card-bd">
      <div class="pics">
        <figure>
          <svg class="thumb" viewBox="0 0 300 170" role="img" aria-label="田间收割示意图">
            <rect width="300" height="170" fill="#f3f7ea"/>
            <circle cx="248" cy="38" r="20" fill="#f0c04a"/>
